Backtrack with open/close counts. O(4^n / sqrt(n)).

For gen parens n=1 I will add '(' when open<n and ')' when close<open.

```python
def gen(n):
    out = []
    def rec(cur, o, c):
        if len(cur) == 2 * n:
            out.append(''.join(cur)); return
        if o < n:
            cur.append('('); rec(cur, o + 1, c); cur.pop()
        if c < o:
            cur.append(')'); rec(cur, o, c + 1); cur.pop()
    rec([], 0, 0)
    return out
```

